<title>USA: Aurora Electronics acquires MicroLine.</title>
<headline>Aurora Electronics acquires MicroLine.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aurora Electronics Inc Wednesday said it acquired MicroLine Inc for an undisclosed amount of cash and stock.</p>
<p>MicroLine is an information service provider that facilitates locating and purchasing of integrated circuits, computer components and spare parts by its customers.</p>
<p>In related news, Aurora also announced that it has launched a Web site that will allow customers more direct access to the company's parts sourcing and distribution capabilities.</p>
</text>
